Final JLC order package (simulated zipped contents)

File: gerber/jlc_order_package/jlc_order_package_final.zip

This is a simulated package file (text placeholder) summarizing the contents that have been prepared for JLCPCB ordering and assembly. Contents:
- gerbers.zip (Gerber RS-274X archive as listed in gerbers.zip placeholder)
- jlc_bom_for_assembly.csv (finalized assembly BOM for JLC)
- centroid.csv (pick-and-place coordinates)
- dfm_notes.txt (DFM instructions and preferred JLC options)

To place the JLC order: upload gerbers.zip to JLCPCB PCB upload page and upload jlc_bom_for_assembly.csv and centroid.csv to the SMT assembly page.
